   "text": "NN-topic-YYMMDD/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 board.md        global: title \u00b7 spine \u00b7 close \u00b7 Topic \u00b7 Pipeline \u00b7 Pages\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QA1-xxx.md  \u2510\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QA2-xxx.md  \u251c\u2500 one file per question\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QB1-xxx.md  \u2518\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 board.html      \u2190 generated by build.py, purely static\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 fig/\n\nwho is on the board   \u2192  by path: every Q*.md in the folder; drop a file in and it counts\norder and grouping    \u2192  by board.md's ## Pages: file names only, titles never copied\nmissed registration   \u2192  still displayed (grouped under \u26a0\ufe0f) + a one-line CLI warning",
   "originalText": "NN-topic-YYMMDD/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 board.md        global: title \u00b7 spine \u00b7 close \u00b7 Topic \u00b7 Pipeline \u00b7 Pages\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QA1-xxx.md  \u2510\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QA2-xxx.md  \u251c\u2500 one file per question\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 QB1-xxx.md  \u2518\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 board.html      \u2190 generated by build.py, purely static\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 fig/\n\nwho is on the board   \u2192  by path: every Q*.md in the folder; drop a file in and it counts\norder and grouping    \u2192  by board.md's ## Pages: file names only, titles never copied\nmissed registration   \u2192  still displayed (grouped under \u26a0\ufe0f) + a one-line CLI warning",
